*> vybe-test: cobol/strings_and_text/inspect_tallying_counts_all_matches
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_strings_and_text.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-TXT PIC X(10) VALUE "ABCA".
01 WS-COUNT PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    INSPECT WS-TXT TALLYING WS-COUNT FOR ALL "A".
    DISPLAY WS-COUNT.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-COUNT DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "0002"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [0002] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

